{"title":"좌우맹","artist":"요루시카","sourceId":"reference:KIotrYsq70pnmsOWVMgF","sourceHash":"d87fd521f5d0b4ef9438990431db96bf9d4ee85fdbe1083793626c10dcb4227a","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.06,"end":4.0600000000000005,"text":"君の右手は頬を突いている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":7.64,"end":10.64,"text":"僕は左手に温いマグカップ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":13.54,"end":16.54,"text":"君の右眉は少し垂れている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":20.14,"end":23.14,"text":"朝がこんなにも降った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":25.64,"end":27.48,"text":"一つでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":27.48,"end":30.48,"text":"散らぬ牡丹の一つでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":30.64,"end":32.71,"text":"君の胸を打て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":32.71,"end":35.71,"text":"心を忘れるほどの幸福を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":38.37,"end":40.13,"text":"一つでいいんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":40.13,"end":43.13,"text":"右も左もわからぬほどに手探りの夜の中を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":51.12,"end":54.12,"text":"一人行くその静けさを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":57.34,"end":60.34,"text":"その一つを教えられたなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":64.26,"end":67.26,"text":"君の左眉は少し垂れている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":70.67,"end":73.67,"text":"上手く思い出せない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":73.78999999999999,"end":76.78,"text":"僕にはわからないみたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":76.78,"end":79.78,"text":"君の右手にはいつか買った小説","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":83.12,"end":86.12,"text":"あれ それって左手だっけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":95.12,"end":96.97999999999999,"text":"一つでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":96.97999999999999,"end":99.97999999999999,"text":"夜の日差しの一つでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":100.18,"end":103.18,"text":"君の胸を打つ 心を覗けるほどの感傷を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":107.7,"end":109.3,"text":"一つでいいんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":109.3,"end":112.3,"text":"夏に舞う雹のその中も手探りで行けることを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":120.56,"end":123.56,"text":"君の目は閉じぬことを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":139.53,"end":142.53,"text":"僕の身体から心を少しずつ剥がして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":147.56,"end":150.56,"text":"君に渡して その全部をあげるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":152.02,"end":155.02,"text":"剣の柄からルビーを この瞳からサファイアを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":159.05,"end":162.05,"text":"鉛の心臓はただ傍に置いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":167.85,"end":169.57999999999998,"text":"一つでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":169.57999999999998,"end":172.57999999999998,"text":"散らぬ牡丹の一つでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":172.77,"end":174.96,"text":"君の胸を打て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":174.96,"end":177.96,"text":"涙も忘れるほどの幸福を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":180.47,"end":182.26,"text":"少しでいいんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":182.26,"end":185.26,"text":"今日の小雨が止むための太陽を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":193.02,"end":194.91,"text":"少しでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":194.91,"end":197.91,"text":"君の世界に少しでいい僕の靴跡を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":200.15,"end":203.15,"text":"わかるだろうか 君の幸福は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":205.64,"end":207.57999999999998,"text":"一つじゃないんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":207.57999999999998,"end":210.57999999999998,"text":"右も左もわからぬほどに手探りの夜の中を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":218.45,"end":221.45,"text":"君が行く長いこれからを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":224.89,"end":227.89,"text":"僕だけは笑わぬことを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":231.22,"end":234.22,"text":"その一つを教えられたなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":241.18,"end":244.18,"text":"何を食べても味がしないんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":247.63,"end":250.63,"text":"身体が消えてしまったようだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":253.68,"end":256.68,"text":"貴方の心と 私の心が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":259.85,"end":262.85,"text":"ずっと一つだと思ってたんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}